WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:03.000
Leo-sama has kept the pain and

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.310
suffering to herself and fought hard...

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.250
Princess Millefi came to the front line

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.230
Can we not change the future 
determined by the stars?

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.950
Someone do something or
Leo-sama and the Princess will...

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:20.040
Please... Someone... Help them!

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.120
Hero, Princess, and a Ray of Hope

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:21.410
Is that... a local earth god?

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.740
No, it isn't.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.290
Remember Dalkian told 
us about them before...

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:31.810
...it's probably a fearsome demon

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:58.240
Leo-sama..., Princess Millefi!

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.150
Millefi!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:25.050
It might be a big and 
scary demon, but...

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.190
She's... crying...?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:16.980
Millefi, are you alright?

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:18.750
Y, yes!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.320
Leo-sama! Watch out!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.990
Don't, Millefi!

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:37.580
Millefi...

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.860
Millefi!

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.100
D...

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.030
Damn you!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.230
Millefi! Millefi!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.460
She should still be alright...

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:57.920
Leo-sama!

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.920
Leo-sama!

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:28.740
What? Is it trying to leave here?

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.420
Rouge?

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.290
Oh, Chief! Hero!

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.250
Her highness, Leo!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.150
Did the demon?

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:40.920
Yes...

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.670
And Princess Millefi!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:00.320
The princess is being 
absorbed by the demon...

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.450
...but the protection of the 
holy sword is still working...

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.790
It all depends on the 
Princess's shining power.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.380
Once the Princess's 
shining power runs out,

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.130
do you mean she'll be 
absorbed by that demon?

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.080
Yes...

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.200
It can't happen!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.080
I won't let it!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.490
Princess...

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.750
Princess of the Holy Sword...

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.280
Yes?

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.340
I apologize...

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.020
...my child has done something 
terrible to you...

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:03.220
It's going further away...

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.040
No...

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.270
We can use the floating rocks...

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:12.610
The protective flonya 
power is weak here!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.510
That just means we can't fall!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:17.720
Tornader!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.100
Wait! I'm going, too!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.730
I thought so!

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.750
So then, Rouge!

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.270
We're off to save our princess!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.470
It's a lot of jumping and winding!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.600
I will attack and protect!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.000
Way to go, chief!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.150
Shut up!

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:17.050
Okay! This is no big deal!

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.910
Run, jump... and reach the goal...

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.920
...at the shortest distance!

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.590
I, I'm probably not the one to say this

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.650
Of course I am!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.420
Eclair! Get down!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.340
Hero!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.870
What's worse that being scared

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.790
or being in pain...

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.290
...is not meeting expectations!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.790
Someone believes in me 
and is waiting for me.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.800
To let them down would 
hurt a billion times more!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.550
Go!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.140
Hero! It's not gonna reach it!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.020
It will! It will! I'll make it!

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:33.900
Leave it to me!
I will get it there for sure!

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.090
Leave it to you?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.160
I'll send you up using seal power!
You better get on!

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.910
You better get the Princess!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.670
Eclair!

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.420
I'll be right there! Go ahead!

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:57.740
Got it!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.440
Is that it?

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:15.020
Eclair, she sent me ahead!

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.780
I'm in a hurry!

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.530
So... Get out of the way!

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:13.060
I'm really happy that
there are people

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.080
who believe in me...

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.450
I feel lucky...

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:22.880
It's just like that day...

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.060
My mother and father who came to

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.390
the arena the day of 
the championships...

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:35.620
My dear friends who cheered me on...

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:44.410
The sweet girl who told me

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.000
That day, I couldn't 
become their hero...

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.310
...but today I will!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.710
From now on I am the hero!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:00.610
Shining power!

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:03.220
Full force!

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.360
This happened hundreds of years ago...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.840
Back then the land

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:13.820
was still mostly untouched by man...

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:17.630
I was an earth god,

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:24.240
But then one day...

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:38.440
There was lightning,
and a sword came

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:41.000
down and pierced my child's body...

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:51.970
And he became a fearsome demon...

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.730
I was absorbed by him...

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.090
...and as a demon,

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:09.040
my child devoured the 
creatures of the hills,

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.220
About 200 years ago,

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.410
...but was sealed by the one

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.980
wielding a holy sword...

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.210
...but perhaps the seal had weakened,

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.260
or it was attracted to the 
scent of your holy sword...

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:31.260
My child has awakened once again.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.400
My child is now a demon 
of destruction...,

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.910
but ever since he was 
turned into a demon...

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.910
...he has been crying...

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.420
What's wrong?

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.070
It hurts...

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.920
It's terrible...

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.430
Please... someone...
Someone...

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.180
Let me die...

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.930
Please... kill me...

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.190
Princess! Princess!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.580
Princess of the Holy Sword...

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.950
With that holy sword, 
please cut off his head...

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.750
If you do that,

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.850
the connection to the 
soul would be separated,

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.960
and the demon will not be 
able to retain its form...

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.520
But...

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.840
I cannot touch my child...

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.340
Please...

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:54.260
I don't want him to suffer any longer.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.850
Princess of the Holy Sword... Please.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.860
I won't do it.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.740
If I were to cut your child here

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.560
the demon may disappear...

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:19.040
...but all the pain and 
suffering won't disappear.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:22.080
I can't imagine how terrible

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:27.130
for you and your child, for so long...

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:32.580
The holy sword of Biscotti,
Excelede and Palladion

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.580
are swords that can cut demons...

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.880
...but they are also swords 
to be used to guide

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.560
people and souls and 
bring hope to the land.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.900
You two are without a doubt 
souls living in Flonyald...

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.590
Your lives cannot end

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:51.900
That's just...

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:00.900
I, Millefiore Filliano 
Biscotti, ruler of Biscotti,

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.800
Princess... Princess?!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.250
Princess!

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.300
Oh... Sink?

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.580
Yes! I'm so relieved!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.070
-Oh, excuse me!
-Oh, oh! I'm sorry!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:39.580
Uh, never mind!
Sink, I want to help the demon!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.330
Help the demon?

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:44.910
This child was just a regular earth god.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.740
If we pull out the red magical 
sword from his body...

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.090
Okay! Princess, you stay here!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.840
No! I'm going too!

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:58.110
Uh... like that?

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:25.500
Excelede... did you do this?

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.340
Huh? Palladion?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.960
Excelede...

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.920
I will try my best!

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.940
So help me out a little!

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:57.400
Sink!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.280
Yes! Princess!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.310
Let's go Princess!

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:18.230
Yes!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:22.080
Straight...

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.680
...to the goal!

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.110
Holy...

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.030
...Saber!

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:22.490
-Princess, I'll take it from here!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.070
Yes!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.740
You!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.060
The soil?

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.810
This is bad, Princess!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.150
Yes, Sink!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:57.950
What?!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.160
Majin...

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:13.160
...Senkou Ha!

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:30.200
Sink! Are you alright?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:33.680
I'm fine! Was that arrow?

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.950
Yes, that was definitely Leo-sama!

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.570
Princess, put the child here!

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.010
Oh, yes!

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.830
Okay, we're escaping 
on the Hero Express!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:57.080
Yes!

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:33.200
I-I'm so sorry!

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:33.930
Oh my.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.720
I can't believe those two when we're taking this seriously!

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:40.100
<b>Like a Flower Floating in the Night Sky</b>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.670
That means we have to cover for them next time, too!
